Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.16,0:00:59.74,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(432,372)}蟹堡王
Dialogue: 1,0:01:02.33,0:01:04.62,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不好意思  我下班了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.33,0:01:04.62,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Sorry, I'm off the clock
Dialogue: 1,0:01:05.12,0:01:09.21,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,现在趁海绵宝宝不注意  赶紧逃
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.12,0:01:09.21,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Now, to make my escape without SpongeBob noticing
Dialogue: 1,0:01:14.92,0:01:16.38,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,完美
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.92,0:01:16.38,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Perfect
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.86,0:01:33.99,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1338,592)}垃圾
Dialogue: 1,0:01:34.61,0:01:37.16,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,就快到了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.61,0:01:37.16,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Almost there
Dialogue: 1,0:01:41.53,0:01:43.62,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,嗨  章鱼哥
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.53,0:01:43.62,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Hi, Squidward
Dialogue: 1,0:01:43.87,0:01:45.20,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,果然
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.87,0:01:45.20,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Of course
Dialogue: 1,0:01:45.46,0:01:46.87,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,抱歉  没空留下来闲聊
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.46,0:01:46.87,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Sorry, no time to stop and chat
Dialogue: 1,0:01:46.87,0:01:47.96,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我下班了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.87,0:01:47.96,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,My shift's over
Dialogue: 1,0:01:47.96,0:01:50.25,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,对啊  也太糟糕了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.96,0:01:50.25,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I know, isn't it awful
Dialogue: 1,0:01:50.50,0:01:51.59,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不过你运气正好
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.50,0:01:51.59,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,But lucky for you
Dialogue: 1,0:01:51.59,0:01:53.55,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我做了个好朋友趣味活动清单
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.59,0:01:53.55,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I've created a list of fun friend activities
Dialogue: 1,0:01:53.55,0:01:55.17,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,可以一直做到下次上班之前
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.55,0:01:55.17,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,that we can do until our next shift
Dialogue: 1,0:01:55.17,0:01:56.72,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,像是涂脚趾甲啊
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.17,0:01:56.72,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Like paint our toenails
Dialogue: 1,0:01:56.72,0:01:57.18,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,或者
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.72,0:01:57.18,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Or--
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.18,0:02:04.18,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(826,706)}裤头村活动中心
Dialogue: 1,0:02:06.31,0:02:07.23,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,抱歉迟到了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.31,0:02:07.23,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Sorry I'm late
Dialogue: 1,0:02:07.73,0:02:08.98,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,没事  章鱼哥
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.73,0:02:08.98,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, Squidward
Dialogue: 1,0:02:08.98,0:02:12.19,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你正好赶上了今天的瑜伽课
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.98,0:02:12.19,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,you're just in time for today's yoga class
Dialogue: 1,0:02:12.40,0:02:13.65,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,章鱼哥
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.40,0:02:13.65,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Hey, Squidward
Dialogue: 1,0:02:13.65,0:02:14.48,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你好吗
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.65,0:02:14.48,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,How's it going?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:19.78,0:02:23.66,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,先从飞升泡泡式做起
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.78,0:02:23.66,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Let's begin with the Rising Bubble pose
Dialogue: 1,0:02:23.91,0:02:24.91,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,吸气
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.91,0:02:24.91,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Breathe in
Dialogue: 1,0:02:29.37,0:02:30.50,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,呼气
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.37,0:02:30.50,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,and out
Dialogue: 1,0:02:34.09,0:02:36.01,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,体势不错  章鱼哥
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.09,0:02:36.01,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Excellent form, Squidward
Dialogue: 1,0:02:36.01,0:02:39.30,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,接下来做水中战士式
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.01,0:02:39.30,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Now let's move on to the Water Warrior position
Dialogue: 1,0:02:40.47,0:02:41.43,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,瑜伽馆
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.47,0:02:41.43,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Yoga studio
Dialogue: 1,0:02:43.68,0:02:44.56,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.68,0:02:44.56,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:45.06,0:02:46.18,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,天啊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.06,0:02:46.18,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Oh, dear
Dialogue: 1,0:02:46.18,0:02:47.52,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我马上就到
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.18,0:02:47.52,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'll be there right away
Dialogue: 1,0:02:47.52,0:02:50.19,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,同学们  发生了一起瑜伽紧急事件
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.52,0:02:50.19,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Class, there's a yoga emergency
Dialogue: 1,0:02:50.19,0:02:55.23,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,有人想结合珊瑚弓步式和站立支脚式
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.19,0:02:52.90,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Someone tried to combine a Coral Lunge
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.90,0:02:55.23,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,with a Standing Sandbar
Dialogue: 1,0:02:55.23,0:02:56.86,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我鼻子好痒
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.23,0:02:56.86,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,My nose itches
Dialogue: 1,0:02:58.74,0:03:01.53,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,恐怕今天的课程取消了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.74,0:03:01.53,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid class is cancelled today
Dialogue: 1,0:03:01.53,0:03:04.45,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我没法及时找到代课教练
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.53,0:03:04.45,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'll never find a substitute instructor in time
Dialogue: 1,0:03:05.74,0:03:08.50,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,可我真的很需要解压
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.74,0:03:08.50,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,But I really need to de-stress
Dialogue: 1,0:03:09.04,0:03:10.96,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我可以带班
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.04,0:03:10.96,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I could lead the class
Dialogue: 1,0:03:11.25,0:03:13.08,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,章鱼哥  你真是救了我一命
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.25,0:03:13.08,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Squidward, you're a lifesaver
Dialogue: 1,0:03:13.08,0:03:14.13,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,如果一切顺利
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.08,0:03:14.13,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,If everything goes well
Dialogue: 1,0:03:14.13,0:03:16.09,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你下次可以做我们的全职教练
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.13,0:03:16.09,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,you could be our next full-time instructor
Dialogue: 1,0:03:17.05,0:03:18.51,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,全职吗
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.05,0:03:18.51,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Full time?
Dialogue: 1,0:03:18.51,0:03:22.39,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我终于能从那个烂堡王辞职了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.51,0:03:22.39,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I could finally quit my job at the crummy Krab
Dialogue: 1,0:03:23.76,0:03:25.47,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,既然都已经热过身了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.76,0:03:25.47,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Now that we're warmed up
Dialogue: 1,0:03:25.47,0:03:29.27,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,一起试试做下潜狗鲨式吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.47,0:03:29.27,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,let's try the Downward Dogfish
Dialogue: 1,0:03:29.48,0:03:31.85,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,使劲拉伸触手
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.48,0:03:31.85,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Really stretch those tentacles
Dialogue: 1,0:03:32.44,0:03:34.11,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,多美好的一天啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.44,0:03:34.11,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What a beautiful day
Dialogue: 1,0:03:34.11,0:03:35.31,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,最棒的就是
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.11,0:03:35.31,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,And best of all
Dialogue: 1,0:03:35.61,0:03:38.03,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,没有海绵宝宝来
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.61,0:03:38.03,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,no SpongeBob to
Dialogue: 1,0:03:38.94,0:03:40.07,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,毁了这一切
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.94,0:03:40.07,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,ruin it
Dialogue: 1,0:03:40.45,0:03:41.70,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,抱歉迟到了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.45,0:03:41.70,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Sorry I'm late
Dialogue: 1,0:03:42.45,0:03:46.45,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,章鱼哥  我都不知道你喜欢瑜伽
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.45,0:03:46.45,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Squidward, I didn't know you liked yoga
Dialogue: 1,0:03:46.45,0:03:47.83,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,能不能从我身上下去
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.45,0:03:47.83,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Would you get off me?
Dialogue: 1,0:03:48.33,0:03:50.08,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,干嘛带着这个大提琴盒
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.33,0:03:50.08,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What's with the cello case?
Dialogue: 1,0:03:50.54,0:03:51.96,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那不是大提琴盒
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.54,0:03:51.96,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It's not a cello case
Dialogue: 1,0:03:51.96,0:03:53.33,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,是派大星盒
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.96,0:03:53.33,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It's a Patrick case
Dialogue: 1,0:03:54.63,0:03:56.38,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,精神病患盒还差不多
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.63,0:03:56.38,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,More like a mental case
Dialogue: 1,0:03:56.38,0:03:58.05,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我们是来练瑜伽的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.38,0:03:58.05,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,We're here for yoga
Dialogue: 1,0:03:58.42,0:04:00.42,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我连酸奶垫都带来了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.42,0:04:00.42,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I even brought my yogurt mat
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.42,0:04:00.42,注释,,0,0,0,,[ yogurt（酸奶）和 yoga（瑜伽）谐音 ]
Dialogue: 1,0:04:07.10,0:04:09.10,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,抱歉  只有预约了才能来上课
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.10,0:04:09.10,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Sorry, this class is by reservation only
Dialogue: 1,0:04:09.47,0:04:11.02,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我们预约过了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.47,0:04:11.02,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,We have reservations
Dialogue: 1,0:04:11.02,0:04:13.39,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,连小票票我们都带了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.02,0:04:13.39,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,We even brought "receep-ts"
Dialogue: 1,0:04:13.85,0:04:18.15,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,算了  你们待在后排别吵就好
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.85,0:04:18.15,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Fine, as long as you stay in the back row and be quiet
Dialogue: 1,0:04:21.90,0:04:27.74,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,瑜伽代表着身心与灵魂的相互连结
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.90,0:04:24.99,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Yoga represents the interconnectedness
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.99,0:04:27.74,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,of mind, body, and spirit
Dialogue: 1,0:04:29.04,0:04:29.83,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.04,0:04:29.83,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Yes?
Dialogue: 1,0:04:30.08,0:04:31.95,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我能去上厕所吗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.08,0:04:31.95,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Can I go to the bathroom?
Dialogue: 1,0:04:32.25,0:04:34.92,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你当然可以了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.25,0:04:34.92,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Yes, of course you can
Dialogue: 1,0:04:35.42,0:04:36.63,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,只是问问而已
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.42,0:04:36.63,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Just checking
Dialogue: 1,0:04:36.96,0:04:37.54,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,白痴
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.96,0:04:37.54,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Moron
Dialogue: 1,0:04:37.54,0:04:38.54,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,继续
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.54,0:04:38.54,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Moving on
Dialogue: 1,0:04:38.54,0:04:43.72,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,大家来做翻车鱼拜日式
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.54,0:04:40.63,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,everyone get into position
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.63,0:04:43.72,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,for the Sunfish Salutation
Dialogue: 1,0:04:49.85,0:04:51.52,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我这么做对吗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.85,0:04:51.52,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Am I doing this right?
Dialogue: 1,0:04:51.97,0:04:54.23,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不对  应该是这样
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.97,0:04:54.23,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Nah, it's more like this
Dialogue: 1,0:04:55.19,0:04:56.06,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,因为我以为
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.19,0:04:56.06,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,'Cause I thought that--
Dialogue: 1,0:04:56.06,0:04:57.94,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,练瑜伽不准讲话
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.06,0:04:57.94,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,There's no talking during yoga
Dialogue: 1,0:04:59.52,0:05:00.82,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,也不准傻笑
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.52,0:05:00.82,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Or giggling
Dialogue: 1,0:05:06.41,0:05:11.20,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,仔细看我示范肺鱼弓步式
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.41,0:05:11.20,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Follow closely as I perform the Lungfish Lunge
Dialogue: 1,0:05:11.49,0:05:14.16,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,感受那股拉伸作用在腿
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.49,0:05:14.16,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Feel that stretch in your ham
Dialogue: 1,0:05:15.12,0:05:16.17,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,筋上
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.12,0:05:16.17,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,strings?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.38,0:05:26.13,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1196,664)}瑞奇马林\N疯狂鱼生
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.38,0:05:26.13,注释,,0,0,0,,[ 改自瑞奇马丁《疯狂人生》，电影3插曲 ]
Dialogue: 1,0:05:25.30,0:05:26.68,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,天啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.30,0:05:26.68,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Oh, boy
Dialogue: 1,0:05:32.68,0:05:33.98,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那还差不多
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.68,0:05:33.98,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That's more like--
Dialogue: 1,0:05:35.31,0:05:36.94,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我今天想听迪斯科
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.31,0:05:36.94,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm feeling disco today
Dialogue: 1,0:05:38.06,0:05:40.65,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,听放克会害我起疹子
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.06,0:05:40.65,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Funk makes me break out in hives
Dialogue: 1,0:05:40.65,0:05:42.19,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你们俩傻子在干嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.65,0:05:42.19,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What are you dolts doing?
Dialogue: 1,0:05:42.82,0:05:44.61,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我们想要更带劲的音乐
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.82,0:05:44.61,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,We wanted music with more oomph
Dialogue: 1,0:05:44.82,0:05:48.28,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,对啊  你那无聊的音乐给我们听困了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.82,0:05:48.28,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Yeah, your boring music was putting us to sleep
Dialogue: 1,0:05:50.53,0:05:54.25,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,反正真正的瑜伽大师都是安静地练习
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.53,0:05:54.25,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,True yoga masters practice in silence anyway
Dialogue: 1,0:05:55.00,0:05:57.37,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,想让那俩傻子会放弃
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.00,0:05:57.37,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'll bet those two dolts will give up
Dialogue: 1,0:05:57.37,0:06:00.67,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,让他们做点高级的姿势多半就行了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.37,0:06:00.67,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,if I put them through some advanced poses
Dialogue: 1,0:06:02.09,0:06:06.34,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,现在来试试蝌蚪扭转式
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.09,0:06:06.34,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Now, we will attempt the Tadpole Twist
Dialogue: 1,0:06:13.35,0:06:16.06,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,水母乱舞式
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.35,0:06:16.06,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,The Jellyfish Jumble
Dialogue: 1,0:06:23.69,0:06:26.11,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,来看看他们能不能受得住这个
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.69,0:06:26.11,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Let's see if they can handle this one
Dialogue: 1,0:06:26.44,0:06:30.45,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,最后是躲猫猫鼠海豚式
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.44,0:06:30.45,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,And finally, the Peek-a-boo Porpoise
Dialogue: 1,0:06:39.33,0:06:40.63,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好耶
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.33,0:06:40.63,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah
Dialogue: 1,0:06:40.63,0:06:42.17,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,感受拉伸
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.63,0:06:42.17,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Feel that stretch
Dialogue: 1,0:06:42.17,0:06:44.96,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,给我们来个难的  章鱼哥
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.17,0:06:44.96,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Give us a hard one, Squidward
Dialogue: 1,0:06:46.67,0:06:48.80,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,得来点狠招
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.67,0:06:48.80,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I need to try something drastic
Dialogue: 1,0:06:49.18,0:06:51.30,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,作为特别款待
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.18,0:06:51.30,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,As a special treat
Dialogue: 1,0:06:51.30,0:06:55.39,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,下面就来练一段海山羊瑜伽
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.30,0:06:55.39,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,we'll have a session of sea-goat yoga
Dialogue: 1,0:07:00.44,0:07:02.90,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好可爱的山羊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.44,0:07:02.90,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That's a cute goat
Dialogue: 1,0:07:17.04,0:07:18.04,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,章鱼哥
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.04,0:07:18.04,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Oh, Squidward
Dialogue: 1,0:07:18.04,0:07:20.00,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我跟派大星没分到羊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.04,0:07:20.00,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Patrick and I didn't get a goat
Dialogue: 1,0:07:20.00,0:07:22.08,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,鉴于这是你们第一次上课
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.00,0:07:22.08,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Since this is your first class
Dialogue: 1,0:07:22.08,0:07:26.34,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我要给你们一头非常特别的海山羊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.08,0:07:26.34,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm giving you a very special sea-goat
Dialogue: 1,0:07:32.84,0:07:35.81,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那头羊一定会撕碎他们
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.84,0:07:35.81,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That goat will tear them apart
Dialogue: 1,0:07:38.52,0:07:39.64,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,体势不错
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.52,0:07:39.64,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Excellent form
Dialogue: 1,0:07:41.10,0:07:41.69,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不对不对
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.10,0:07:41.69,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,No, no, no
Dialogue: 1,0:07:41.69,0:07:43.69,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你做得完全不对  你这笨羊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.69,0:07:43.69,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You're doing it all wrong, you stupid goat
Dialogue: 1,0:07:47.23,0:07:48.32,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不对不对  不对
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.23,0:07:48.32,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,No, no, no-no
Dialogue: 1,0:07:48.90,0:07:50.19,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,冷静一下
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.90,0:07:50.19,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,let's calm down
Dialogue: 1,0:07:50.61,0:07:53.11,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,找回你们内心的小孩
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.61,0:07:53.11,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Find your inner child, um
Dialogue: 1,0:07:53.11,0:07:53.66,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,小羊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.11,0:07:53.66,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,kid
Dialogue: 1,0:07:57.91,0:07:58.54,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,救命
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.91,0:07:58.54,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Help
Dialogue: 1,0:07:59.66,0:08:00.62,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,别打脸
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.66,0:08:00.62,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Not the face
Dialogue: 1,0:08:07.25,0:08:10.42,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,必须赶走那两个蠢蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.25,0:08:10.42,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I have to get rid of those two twits
Dialogue: 1,0:08:10.42,0:08:12.63,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,免得今天全被他们毁了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.42,0:08:12.63,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,before they ruin everything
Dialogue: 1,0:08:13.30,0:08:20.10,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,接下来练一段振奋精神的热瑜伽
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.30,0:08:20.10,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,And now for an invigorating session of hot yoga
Dialogue: 1,0:08:26.73,0:08:28.36,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你们在干嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.73,0:08:28.36,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 1,0:08:28.61,0:08:32.28,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这水温正好能煮一碗好喝的汤
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.61,0:08:30.28,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,The water temperature is perfect
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.28,0:08:32.28,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,for whipping up a delicious soup
Dialogue: 1,0:08:32.28,0:08:37.66,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,来碗西兰花切达杂烩汤最能润嗓子了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.28,0:08:34.20,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Nothing wets your whistle
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.20,0:08:37.66,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,like a bowl of broccoli cheddar chowder
Dialogue: 1,0:08:37.66,0:08:39.24,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我不练了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.66,0:08:39.24,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm outta here
Dialogue: 1,0:08:39.24,0:08:40.29,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我也是
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.24,0:08:40.29,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Me too
Dialogue: 1,0:08:40.29,0:08:42.25,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这地方情况越来越差了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.29,0:08:42.25,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,This place has really gone downhill
Dialogue: 1,0:08:43.08,0:08:44.75,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,能带一碗汤打包吗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.08,0:08:44.75,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Can I get a bowl to go?
Dialogue: 1,0:08:44.75,0:08:45.88,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,当然能了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.75,0:08:45.88,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Of course
Dialogue: 1,0:08:51.21,0:08:53.30,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,看起来他很需要补充营养
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.21,0:08:53.30,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Looks like he could use some nourishment
Dialogue: 1,0:08:53.51,0:08:55.22,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你得保持体力
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.51,0:08:55.22,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You've got to keep your strength up
Dialogue: 1,0:09:01.97,0:09:03.23,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,接下来干嘛  章鱼哥
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.97,0:09:03.23,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What's next, Squidward?
Dialogue: 1,0:09:05.94,0:09:09.61,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,瑜伽的所有知识我都教完了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.94,0:09:09.61,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I've taught you everything I know about yoga
Dialogue: 1,0:09:09.86,0:09:10.61,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,除了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.86,0:09:10.61,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,except
Dialogue: 1,0:09:11.11,0:09:16.61,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不行  对于你们俩新手太高深了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.11,0:09:16.61,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Oh, no, it's too advanced for you beginners
Dialogue: 1,0:09:17.36,0:09:19.33,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,求你教教我们  章鱼哥
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.36,0:09:19.33,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Please teach us, Squidward
Dialogue: 1,0:09:19.62,0:09:21.54,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,既然这么确定
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.62,0:09:21.54,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,If you're sure
Dialogue: 1,0:09:21.54,0:09:23.70,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你们的最后一节课
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.54,0:09:23.70,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,For your final lesson
Dialogue: 1,0:09:23.70,0:09:26.12,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,将会尝试达到
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.70,0:09:26.12,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,you will try and achieve
Dialogue: 1,0:09:26.58,0:09:29.00,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,觉醒状态
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.58,0:09:29.00,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,awarenessment
Dialogue: 1,0:09:29.71,0:09:32.76,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,觉醒状态
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.71,0:09:32.76,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Awarenessment
Dialogue: 1,0:09:32.76,0:09:37.84,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,首先  你们两个需要神秘咒语
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.76,0:09:37.84,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,First, you both need secret mantras
Dialogue: 1,0:09:37.84,0:09:39.22,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,神秘
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.84,0:09:39.22,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Secret?
Dialogue: 1,0:09:41.89,0:09:47.69,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,放空你们的头脑  只想着咒语
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.89,0:09:47.69,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Now empty your minds of everything but your mantras
Dialogue: 1,0:09:47.90,0:09:48.90,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,早就放空了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.90,0:09:48.90,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Way ahead of you
Dialogue: 1,0:09:49.77,0:09:51.57,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,白痴
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.77,0:09:51.57,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Moron
Dialogue: 1,0:09:51.73,0:09:53.07,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,笨蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.73,0:09:53.07,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Doofus
Dialogue: 1,0:09:53.07,0:09:54.69,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,白痴
