Dialogue: 1,0:10:38.11,0:10:39.78,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,脑子打结了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.11,0:10:39.78,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Brain knots
Dialogue: 1,0:10:40.91,0:10:42.07,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我回来了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.91,0:10:42.07,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm back
Dialogue: 1,0:10:48.41,0:10:50.62,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我先告辞了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.41,0:10:50.62,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,And I'll see myself out
Dialogue: 1,0:10:51.67,0:10:53.42,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不会吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.67,0:10:53.42,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It can't be
Dialogue: 1,0:10:53.42,0:10:54.63,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不可能
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.42,0:10:54.63,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It's impossible
Dialogue: 1,0:10:54.92,0:10:59.59,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那两个白痴达到了意识状态
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.92,0:10:59.59,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Those two idiots have achieved awarenessment
Dialogue: 1,0:11:00.47,0:11:03.47,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我们必须给这只原始生物提供救助
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.47,0:11:03.47,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,We must render aid to this primitive creature
Dialogue: 1,0:11:03.72,0:11:05.47,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,同意  黄家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.72,0:11:05.47,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Agreed, yellow one
Dialogue: 1,0:11:05.47,0:11:09.64,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我们来送他去看本地医生
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.47,0:11:09.64,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Let us convey him to a local doctor of medicine
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.44,0:11:16.03,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1188,726)}急诊
Dialogue: 1,0:11:16.03,0:11:17.40,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,天啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.03,0:11:17.40,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Oh my
