Dialogue: 1,0:11:20.15,0:11:22.74,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,有没有考虑过做做瑜伽
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.15,0:11:22.74,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Have you thought of trying yoga?
