Dialogue: 1,0:11:56.52,0:11:59.07,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好了  你这肮脏的告密者
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.52,0:11:59.07,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,All right, you dirty rat
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.52,0:11:59.07,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\fs60\pos(1226,920)}耗   子
Dialogue: 1,0:11:59.07,0:12:01.65,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,跟警察说什么了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.07,0:12:01.65,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What did you say to the fuzz?
Dialogue: 1,0:12:01.65,0:12:03.95,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,最好马上从实叫来
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.65,0:12:03.95,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You better start squealin'
Dialogue: 1,0:12:06.62,0:12:07.87,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,把他交给我  小的们
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.62,0:12:07.87,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Leave him to me, boys
Dialogue: 1,0:12:10.00,0:12:13.79,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,该带这只耗子去兜兜风了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.00,0:12:13.79,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It's time me and this rat went for a ride
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.88,0:12:19.46,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(966,296)}碰碰手套
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.46,0:12:23.38,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(986,490)}手套乐园
Dialogue: 1,0:12:23.88,0:12:25.51,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,耗子
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.88,0:12:25.51,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Hey, rat
Dialogue: 1,0:12:35.56,0:12:36.90,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,天啊  海绵宝宝
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.56,0:12:36.90,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Oh boy, SpongeBob
Dialogue: 1,0:12:38.02,0:12:39.32,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,碰碰手套
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.02,0:12:39.32,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Bumper Gloves
Dialogue: 1,0:12:39.32,0:12:40.36,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,终于有游乐设施
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.32,0:12:40.36,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Finally, a ride
Dialogue: 1,0:12:40.36,0:12:43.07,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,能奖励我的超烂驾驶技术了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.36,0:12:43.07,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,that rewards me for my lack of driving skills
Dialogue: 1,0:12:48.37,0:12:49.70,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,小心  派大星
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.37,0:12:49.70,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Careful, Patrick
Dialogue: 1,0:12:49.70,0:12:51.87,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,马上就要狂野起来了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.70,0:12:51.87,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,things are about to get wild
Dialogue: 1,0:12:56.46,0:12:59.46,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我的天性就是狂
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.46,0:12:59.46,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Wild is my middle name
Dialogue: 1,0:13:09.72,0:13:12.02,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,希望你喜欢黄铜指虎味  你个耗子
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.72,0:13:12.02,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Hope you like the taste of brass, you rat
Dialogue: 1,0:13:39.04,0:13:40.34,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,天啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.04,0:13:40.34,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Zut alors
Dialogue: 1,0:13:40.34,0:13:43.42,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,他们的喉咙互换了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.34,0:13:43.42,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Their voice boxes, they have switched
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.34,0:13:43.42,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\fs60\pos(960,920)}音 箱
Dialogue: 1,0:13:55.64,0:13:56.73,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,走了  老大
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.64,0:13:56.73,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Come on, boss
Dialogue: 1,0:13:56.73,0:13:58.35,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我们带你离开这
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.73,0:13:58.35,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,We gotta get you out of here
Dialogue: 1,0:14:02.32,0:14:03.07,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,派大星
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.32,0:14:03.07,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Patrick
Dialogue: 1,0:14:03.07,0:14:06.32,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,刚刚那是我见过最猛的一碰了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.07,0:14:06.32,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That was the biggest bumper bump I've ever seen
Dialogue: 1,0:14:08.03,0:14:08.70,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,没事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.03,0:14:08.70,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.95,0:14:20.92,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(678,272)}公交
Dialogue: 1,0:14:16.41,0:14:18.12,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,可不是嘛  兄弟
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.41,0:14:18.12,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You said it, buddy
Dialogue: 1,0:14:18.12,0:14:19.92,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好了  我得回去上班了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.12,0:14:19.92,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Okay, I gotta get to work
Dialogue: 1,0:14:20.08,0:14:21.29,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这趟公交能载你回家
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.08,0:14:21.29,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,This bus will get you home
Dialogue: 1,0:14:28.84,0:14:29.80,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,明天见
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.84,0:14:29.80,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,See you tomorrow
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.43,0:14:37.35,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(906,584)}高菲高伯
Dialogue: 1,0:14:42.19,0:14:43.23,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,抱歉  兄弟
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.19,0:14:43.23,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Sorry, pal
Dialogue: 1,0:14:43.23,0:14:45.44,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这趟是跨城快线
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.23,0:14:45.44,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,This here's the crosstown express
Dialogue: 1,0:14:45.73,0:14:47.15,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,中途不停车
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.73,0:14:47.15,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,No stopping
Dialogue: 1,0:14:51.24,0:14:53.53,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,先生  请你坐好
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.24,0:14:53.53,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Sir, please sit down
Dialogue: 1,0:14:54.20,0:14:57.20,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,可如果我不早点吃到冰淇淋
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.20,0:14:57.20,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,But if I don't get some ice cream soon
Dialogue: 1,0:14:57.20,0:14:59.37,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,会惹祸上身的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.20,0:14:59.37,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,there's gonna be a problem
Dialogue: 1,0:15:00.21,0:15:02.33,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,唐唐  唐恩疤脸星
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.21,0:15:02.33,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,D-D-Don Scarfish
Dialogue: 1,0:15:02.50,0:15:03.67,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我是说
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.50,0:15:03.67,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I meant, uh
Dialogue: 1,0:15:03.67,0:15:05.59,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你想停哪我们就停哪
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.67,0:15:05.59,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,we'll stop anywhere you want
Dialogue: 1,0:15:05.96,0:15:07.92,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,上门服务  总行吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.96,0:15:07.92,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Door-to-door service, see?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.39,0:15:14.30,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(400,442)}停
Dialogue: 1,0:15:14.56,0:15:15.35,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,谢了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.56,0:15:15.35,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Thanks
Dialogue: 1,0:15:19.23,0:15:20.85,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,欢迎光临高菲高伯
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.23,0:15:20.85,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Welcome to Goofy Goober's
Dialogue: 1,0:15:20.85,0:15:21.48,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,需要什么
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.85,0:15:21.48,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,How may I--
Dialogue: 1,0:15:23.06,0:15:24.27,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,是你啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.06,0:15:24.27,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It's you
Dialogue: 1,0:15:24.61,0:15:26.48,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我不应该服务你的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.61,0:15:26.48,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm not supposed to serve you
Dialogue: 1,0:15:26.48,0:15:27.53,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,要什么东西
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.48,0:15:27.53,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What do you want?
Dialogue: 1,0:15:27.53,0:15:32.24,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我要你们给我做个至尊高伯美味
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.53,0:15:32.24,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I want you to make me one Gooberlicious Maximus
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.32,0:15:32.24,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(604,304)}至尊高伯美味
Dialogue: 1,0:15:33.66,0:15:35.62,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,唐恩疤脸星
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.66,0:15:35.62,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Don Scarfish
Dialogue: 1,0:15:36.37,0:15:39.08,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,对不起  刚刚认错人了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.37,0:15:39.08,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, I thought you were someone else
Dialogue: 1,0:15:41.17,0:15:42.58,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,给你  先生
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.17,0:15:42.58,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Here you go, sir
Dialogue: 1,0:15:42.58,0:15:43.46,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.58,0:15:43.46,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Hold it
Dialogue: 1,0:15:43.67,0:15:46.84,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你带的钱买得起至尊吗
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.67,0:15:46.84,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Do you have enough money to pay for the Maximus?
Dialogue: 1,0:15:53.64,0:15:55.72,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,看来是买不起了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.64,0:15:55.72,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I didn't think so
Dialogue: 1,0:15:58.85,0:16:01.69,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,如果我现在吃不到冰淇淋
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.85,0:16:01.69,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,If I don't get some ice cream now
Dialogue: 1,0:16:01.69,0:16:04.06,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,怕是不知道会干出什么事来
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.69,0:16:04.06,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I don't know what I'll do
Dialogue: 1,0:16:05.23,0:16:06.77,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,唐恩疤脸星
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.23,0:16:06.77,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Don Scarfish?
Dialogue: 1,0:16:06.77,0:16:08.32,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,他什么都干得出来
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.77,0:16:08.32,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,He's capable of anything
Dialogue: 1,0:16:08.32,0:16:10.49,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,快把他的圣代做好  小子
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.32,0:16:10.49,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Quick, finish his sundae, son
Dialogue: 1,0:16:12.61,0:16:13.07,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,还有
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.61,0:16:13.07,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,And uh
Dialogue: 1,0:16:13.82,0:16:15.37,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我们请客
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.82,0:16:15.37,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,it's on the house
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.91,0:16:21.41,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1058,622)}胜海诺匹萨店
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.91,0:16:21.41,注释,,0,0,0,,[ 改自“胜百诺”Sbarro ]
Dialogue: 1,0:16:21.41,0:16:23.04,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,没事吧  老大
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.41,0:16:23.04,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Y-You okay, boss?
Dialogue: 1,0:16:23.25,0:16:24.42,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,说句话
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.25,0:16:24.42,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Talk to us
Dialogue: 1,0:16:29.46,0:16:32.34,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,谢谢你们把我救回来  小子们
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.46,0:16:32.34,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Thanks for pulling me outta there, boys
Dialogue: 1,0:16:32.76,0:16:36.55,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那是我遇过最严重的手套车祸了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.76,0:16:36.55,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That was the worst glove wreck I ever been in
Dialogue: 1,0:16:40.31,0:16:42.89,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你感觉没事吧  老大
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.31,0:16:42.89,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You feeling all right, boss?
Dialogue: 1,0:16:42.89,0:16:44.60,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,当然没事了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.89,0:16:44.60,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Of course I am
Dialogue: 1,0:16:44.60,0:16:46.73,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我健康得不得了儿
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.60,0:16:46.73,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm fit as a fibble
Dialogue: 1,0:16:50.36,0:16:52.03,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不过我饿了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.36,0:16:52.03,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm famished, though
Dialogue: 1,0:16:52.19,0:16:54.07,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,开吃吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.19,0:16:54.07,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Let's mangia
Dialogue: 1,0:16:55.70,0:16:57.87,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,就来一点意大利面儿
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.70,0:16:57.87,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Lemme get some spagheppi
Dialogue: 1,0:16:58.20,0:16:59.79,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,一份奶酪儿沙拉
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.20,0:16:59.79,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,a cheeser salad
Dialogue: 1,0:17:00.12,0:17:01.70,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,再来一份例汤儿
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.12,0:17:01.70,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,and the spoop of the day
Dialogue: 1,0:17:05.67,0:17:06.33,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,干嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.67,0:17:06.33,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 1,0:17:06.58,0:17:07.75,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我很好笑吗
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.58,0:17:07.75,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Am I funny?
Dialogue: 1,0:17:08.04,0:17:10.09,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我逗你们笑了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.04,0:17:10.09,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Do I make you laugh?
Dialogue: 1,0:17:10.63,0:17:12.97,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我乐到你们了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.63,0:17:12.97,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Do I amuse you?
Dialogue: 1,0:17:13.22,0:17:14.84,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,其实没错
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.22,0:17:14.84,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Actually, yeah
Dialogue: 1,0:17:15.05,0:17:17.93,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你的声音听着傻里傻气的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.05,0:17:17.93,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You sound goofy as all get out, boss
Dialogue: 1,0:17:17.93,0:17:19.64,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,没关系
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.93,0:17:19.64,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, it don't matter
Dialogue: 1,0:17:19.64,0:17:22.22,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我还是老大
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.64,0:17:22.22,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm still the boss
Dialogue: 1,0:17:23.31,0:17:25.56,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我还是老大
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.31,0:17:25.56,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,"I'm still the boss"
Dialogue: 1,0:17:34.15,0:17:37.91,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,声音变这样  都没法领导帮派了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.15,0:17:37.91,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I can't lead an outfit sounding like this
Dialogue: 1,0:17:49.84,0:17:52.34,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,吃了这么多冰淇淋  搞得我都饿了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.84,0:17:52.34,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,All that ice cream made me hungry
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.63,0:17:58.14,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1162,212)}第一航海银行
Dialogue: 1,0:17:54.13,0:17:55.09,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好耶
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.13,0:17:55.09,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Oh, boy
Dialogue: 1,0:17:55.38,0:17:57.63,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这地方向来都送免费糖果
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.38,0:17:57.63,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,This place always has free candy
Dialogue: 1,0:17:58.14,0:18:00.22,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这是您取的款项  先生
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.14,0:18:00.22,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Here's your withdrawal, sir
Dialogue: 1,0:18:00.76,0:18:04.35,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,因为你是个乖小孩  送你根棒棒糖
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.76,0:18:04.35,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,And you get a lolly for being a good boy
Dialogue: 1,0:18:08.94,0:18:10.94,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,今天需要什么服务呢
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.94,0:18:10.94,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,And what can I do for you today?
Dialogue: 1,0:18:11.73,0:18:13.90,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我想要你给上一个人的东西
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.73,0:18:13.90,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I want what you gave the last guy
Dialogue: 1,0:18:15.78,0:18:16.74,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,装满吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.78,0:18:16.74,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Fill it up
Dialogue: 1,0:18:18.16,0:18:20.49,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,唐恩疤脸星
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.16,0:18:20.49,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Don Scarfish?
Dialogue: 1,0:18:20.49,0:18:21.12,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,是  先生
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.49,0:18:21.12,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir
Dialogue: 1,0:18:21.12,0:18:22.24,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,马上来  先生
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.12,0:18:22.24,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Right away, sir
Dialogue: 1,0:18:24.75,0:18:25.66,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,拜托别伤害我
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.75,0:18:25.66,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Please don't hurt me
Dialogue: 1,0:18:25.66,0:18:26.58,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我还有家人
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.66,0:18:26.58,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I have a family
Dialogue: 1,0:18:27.04,0:18:27.87,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不会吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.04,0:18:27.87,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,No way
Dialogue: 1,0:18:27.87,0:18:29.37,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我也有家人
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.87,0:18:29.37,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I have a family too
Dialogue: 1,0:18:31.50,0:18:32.59,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好  再见
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.50,0:18:32.59,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Okay, bye
Dialogue: 1,0:18:37.51,0:18:38.30,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,钱
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.51,0:18:38.30,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Money?
Dialogue: 1,0:18:38.30,0:18:39.72,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,可我要的是糖果
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.30,0:18:39.72,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,But I wanted candy
Dialogue: 1,0:18:45.93,0:18:47.23,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,让开
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.93,0:18:47.23,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Out of the way
Dialogue: 1,0:18:47.48,0:18:49.56,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我们要抢劫这家银行
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.48,0:18:49.56,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,We're gonna rob this bank here
Dialogue: 1,0:18:50.15,0:18:50.98,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,祝你们好运
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.15,0:18:50.98,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Good luck
Dialogue: 1,0:18:51.23,0:18:53.94,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,银行给了我这个  应该没剩多少钱了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.23,0:18:53.94,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,They can't have much money left after giving me this
Dialogue: 1,0:18:55.44,0:18:56.69,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,谢了  小子
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.44,0:18:56.69,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Thanks, kid
Dialogue: 1,0:18:56.69,0:19:00.20,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你帮我们腾出了一整个下午
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.69,0:19:00.20,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You just freed up our whole afternoon
Dialogue: 1,0:19:00.20,0:19:02.87,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,既然你声音这么猛
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.20,0:19:02.87,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You know, with your tough guy voice
Dialogue: 1,0:19:02.87,0:19:04.66,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,又这么热衷犯罪
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.87,0:19:04.66,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,and penchant for crimes
Dialogue: 1,0:19:04.66,0:19:08.04,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,肯定特别适合当我们帮派的领导
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.66,0:19:08.04,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,you'd make the perfect leader for our organization
Dialogue: 1,0:19:08.58,0:19:09.92,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,怎么样啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.58,0:19:09.92,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What do you say?
Dialogue: 1,0:19:10.46,0:19:12.54,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我不知道那什么意思
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.46,0:19:12.54,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I don't know what that means
Dialogue: 1,0:19:12.54,0:19:14.46,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不过我喜欢交新朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.54,0:19:14.46,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,but I like making new friends
Dialogue: 1,0:19:15.55,0:19:17.01,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我接受
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.55,0:19:17.01,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I accept
Dialogue: 1,0:19:19.63,0:19:22.43,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那接下来要干嘛呢  新老大
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.63,0:19:22.43,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,So, what's our next move, new boss?
Dialogue: 1,0:19:23.35,0:19:24.51,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,有了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.35,0:19:24.51,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I know
Dialogue: 1,0:19:24.51,0:19:26.39,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,去捉水母吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.51,0:19:26.39,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Let's go jellyfishing
Dialogue: 1,0:19:35.98,0:19:37.15,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好了  大伙儿
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.98,0:19:37.15,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,All right, fellas
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.15,0:19:38.61,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1446,362)}水母田\N一里
Dialogue: 1,0:19:37.15,0:19:38.03,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这边走
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.15,0:19:38.03,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,This way
Dialogue: 1,0:19:39.32,0:19:41.20,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,是手套乐园的那小子
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.32,0:19:41.20,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That's the kid from Glove World
Dialogue: 1,0:19:41.49,0:19:44.45,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我的声音在他身上
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.49,0:19:44.45,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,And he's got my voice
Dialogue: 1,0:19:49.00,0:19:50.25,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我们到了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.00,0:19:50.25,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Here we are
Dialogue: 1,0:19:50.58,0:19:52.83,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,水母田
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.58,0:19:52.83,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Jellyfish Fields
Dialogue: 1,0:19:52.83,0:19:55.92,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,现在我只要你们抓住这些水母
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.83,0:19:55.92,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Now all I need you to do is get these jellyfish
Dialogue: 1,0:19:55.92,0:19:58.09,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,没问题  新老大
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.92,0:19:58.09,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,No problem, new boss
Dialogue: 1,0:19:58.30,0:19:59.72,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,新老大吗
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.30,0:19:59.72,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,New boss?
Dialogue: 1,0:20:13.35,0:20:14.69,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好了  小子
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.35,0:20:14.69,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,All right, kid
Dialogue: 1,0:20:17.61,0:20:20.40,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,最好把声音还给我
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.61,0:20:20.40,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You better give me my voice back
Dialogue: 1,0:20:21.49,0:20:22.70,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你在说什么
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.49,0:20:22.70,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What're you talking about?
Dialogue: 1,0:20:22.99,0:20:24.61,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你的声音
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.99,0:20:24.61,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Your voice
Dialogue: 1,0:20:24.61,0:20:26.58,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,是从我身上偷走的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.61,0:20:26.58,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You stole it from me
Dialogue: 1,0:20:26.58,0:20:28.41,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,要不听听你在说什么
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.58,0:20:28.41,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Do you even hear yourself?
Dialogue: 1,0:20:28.95,0:20:31.33,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我怎么能听到自己说什么
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.95,0:20:31.33,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,How am I supposed to hear myself?
Dialogue: 1,0:20:31.33,0:20:32.66,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我连耳朵都没有
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.33,0:20:32.66,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I don't have any ears
Dialogue: 1,0:20:33.21,0:20:33.92,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.21,0:20:33.92,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 1,0:20:33.92,0:20:35.63,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,既然你听不到
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.92,0:20:35.63,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,If you can't hear
Dialogue: 1,0:20:35.63,0:20:36.38,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那我们怎么
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.63,0:20:36.38,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,how are we--
Dialogue: 1,0:20:37.38,0:20:38.59,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不管了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.38,0:20:38.59,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Never mind
Dialogue: 1,0:20:38.84,0:20:41.21,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,把声音还给我
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.84,0:20:41.21,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Just give me my voice back
Dialogue: 1,0:20:47.18,0:20:47.85,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,回来
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.18,0:20:47.85,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Come back
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.93,0:20:55.02,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(282,324)}蟹堡王
Dialogue: 1,0:20:57.36,0:20:58.69,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,海绵宝宝
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.36,0:20:58.69,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,SpongeBob
Dialogue: 1,0:20:58.69,0:20:59.90,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,救命啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.69,0:20:59.90,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You gotta help
Dialogue: 1,0:21:00.28,0:21:01.19,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,嗨  派大星
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.28,0:21:01.19,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Hi, Patrick
Dialogue: 1,0:21:02.49,0:21:04.20,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你在这啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.49,0:21:04.20,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,There you are
Dialogue: 1,0:21:07.62,0:21:12.33,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我要从你脑袋把音箱扒出来
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.62,0:21:12.33,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna tear that voice box outta your head
Dialogue: 1,0:21:19.71,0:21:21.88,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,离我朋友远一点
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.71,0:21:21.88,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Leave my friend alone
Dialogue: 1,0:21:29.85,0:21:31.43,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,谢了  海绵宝宝
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.85,0:21:31.43,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Thanks, SpongeBob
Dialogue: 1,0:21:47.91,0:21:48.82,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不好了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.91,0:21:48.82,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,No
Dialogue: 1,0:21:48.82,0:21:52.24,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,喉咙再一次飞出来了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.82,0:21:52.24,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Zee voice boxes are on the loose once more
Dialogue: 1,0:21:53.37,0:21:54.66,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好痒啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.37,0:21:54.66,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That tickles
Dialogue: 1,0:22:05.26,0:22:07.68,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好了  我们特地过来逮捕
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.26,0:22:07.68,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,All right, we're here to arrest
Dialogue: 1,0:22:07.68,0:22:11.39,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,今天下午抢了裤头村银行的那位
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.68,0:22:10.26,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,the guy that robbed the Bikini Bottom Bank
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.26,0:22:11.39,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,this afternoon
Dialogue: 1,0:22:12.97,0:22:14.39,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,天啊  警长
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.97,0:22:14.39,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Holy mackerel, lieutenant
Dialogue: 1,0:22:14.39,0:22:15.73,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,是唐恩疤脸星
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.39,0:22:15.73,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It's Don Scarfish
Dialogue: 1,0:22:15.73,0:22:17.48,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好了  疤脸星
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.73,0:22:17.48,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,All right, Scarfish
Dialogue: 1,0:22:17.48,0:22:19.15,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你被逮捕了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.48,0:22:19.15,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,you're under arrest
Dialogue: 1,0:22:19.44,0:22:21.57,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你有权保持沉默
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.44,0:22:21.57,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You have the right to remain silent
Dialogue: 1,0:22:26.74,0:22:27.95,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那倒提醒我了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.74,0:22:27.95,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That reminds me
Dialogue: 1,0:22:27.95,0:22:29.20,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我得去银行
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.95,0:22:29.20,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I gotta go to the bank
Dialogue: 1,0:22:29.20,0:22:31.24,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,到时给你带根棒棒糖  派大星
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.20,0:22:31.24,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'll get you a lollipop, Patrick
Dialogue: 1,0:22:31.45,0:22:34.24,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,等我先去取一大笔钱
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.45,0:22:34.24,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,After I make a big withdrawal
